data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_021d1f8d4b408b7b016acadedf6168819587adce4abc1a29eb","output_index":0,"sequence_number":93,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test migrations**\n\nI’m thinking about how fixture deletes history and whether I need to update it. For the migration from task011, I might need to use the initial seed before starting the existing task. But I wonder if this will disrupt the IDs. It seems like a new test migration should happen after stopping the drop history, manually setting positions, and then starting again. At the end, I can drop history from the previous version and test the order migration."}

